{
 "annotations": {
  "list": []
 },
 "editable": true,
 "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "id": null,
 "uid": "alerting",
 "links": [],
 "liveNow": false,
 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "id": 1,
   "title": "Alerter",
   "description": "What the alerter is doing. ARMED: at least one source is on and has a command (its own or the default). NO COMMAND: sources are on but nothing would run -- set a command below. NOTHING ENABLED: no source is switched on. QUERY FAILING: a source's InfluxDB query failed on the last poll (see `docker compose logs alerter`). NOT RUNNING: no health point in the last 5 minutes -- the service is stopped or was never started.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 6,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "influxdb",
    "uid": "${site}"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "influxdb",
      "uid": "${site}"
     },
     "query": "import \"array\"\n\nlatest = from(bucket: \"network_traffic\")\n  |> range(start: -5m)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"alerter\" and r._field == \"state_code\")\n  |> last()\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_value\"])\n\nunion(tables: [latest, array.from(rows: [{_value: -1}])])\n  |> max()\n",
     "rawQuery": true,
     "resultFormat": "time_series"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "decimals": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "-1": {
         "text": "NOT RUNNING",
         "color": "#9ca3af",
         "index": 0
        },
        "0": {
         "text": "QUERY FAILING",
         "color": "#d03b3b",
         "index": 1
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "NOTHING ENABLED",
         "color": "#fab219",
         "index": 2
        },
        "2": {
         "text": "NO COMMAND",
         "color": "#ec835a",
         "index": 3
        },
        "3": {
         "text": "ARMED",
         "color": "#0ca30c",
         "index": 4
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#9ca3af",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "orientation": "auto",
    "textMode": "value",
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
    "showPercentChange": false,
    "text": {
     "titleSize": 16,
     "valueSize": 30
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "id": 2,
   "title": "Control",
   "description": "ENABLED: the links and boxes on this board change the rules. READ-ONLY: ALERTING_CONTROL=ro in the host's .env; commands still run, nothing here changes them. OTHER SITE: the Site box points at another instance; this board only ever acts on the instance serving it.\n\nAnyone who can open this dashboard can change a command, and a command is a shell command on this host: the Infinity datasource calls the alerter with its own identity, not the viewer's. That is why a typed command only takes effect after Confirm (a one-time code), and why commands run as nobody with no access to the stack's credentials. Every change is audited in alerting_control.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 4,
    "x": 6,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
    "uid": "infinity"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
      "uid": "infinity"
     },
     "type": "json",
     "parser": "backend",
     "source": "url",
     "format": "table",
     "url": "http://alerter:8090/status?enable=${enable:percentencode}&disable=${disable:percentencode}&severity=${severity:percentencode}&command_for=${command_for:percentencode}&command=${command:percentencode}&confirm=${confirm:percentencode}&cancel=${cancel:percentencode}&test=${test:percentencode}&site=${site}",
     "url_options": {
      "method": "GET"
     },
     "root_selector": "",
     "columns": [
      {
       "selector": "control",
       "text": "control",
       "type": "number"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "decimals": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "READ-ONLY",
         "color": "#fab219",
         "index": 0
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "ENABLED",
         "color": "#0ca30c",
         "index": 1
        },
        "2": {
         "text": "OTHER SITE",
         "color": "#9ca3af",
         "index": 2
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#9ca3af",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "orientation": "auto",
    "textMode": "value",
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
