  {
   "type": "stat",
   "id": 4,
   "title": "Commands Run",
   "description": "Commands that exited 0 in the dashboard's time range (tests included).",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 3,
    "x": 18,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "influxdb",
    "uid": "${site}"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "influxdb",
      "uid": "${site}"
     },
     "query": "import \"array\"\n\nran = from(bucket: \"network_traffic\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"alert_dispatch\" and r._field == \"count\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r.result == \"ok\" or r.result == \"test-ok\")\n  |> sum()\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()\n\nunion(tables: [ran, array.from(rows: [{_value: 0}])])\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()\n",
     "rawQuery": true,
     "resultFormat": "time_series"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "decimals": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "mappings": [],
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#3b82f6",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "orientation": "auto",
    "textMode": "value",
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
    "showPercentChange": false,
    "text": {
     "titleSize": 16,
     "valueSize": 36
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "id": 5,
   "title": "Failed",
   "description": "Alerts whose command did not succeed in the time range: a non-zero exit, a timeout (ALERTING_COMMAND_TIMEOUT), or held back by the per-minute cap (ALERTING_MAX_PER_MINUTE) or a full queue. Recent Alerts below says which and shows the command's output.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 3,
    "x": 21,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "influxdb",
    "uid": "${site}"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "influxdb",
      "uid": "${site}"
     },
     "query": "import \"array\"\n\nbad = from(bucket: \"network_traffic\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"alert_dispatch\" and r._field == \"count\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r.result !~ /^(ok|test-ok)$/)\n  |> sum()\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()\n\nunion(tables: [bad, array.from(rows: [{_value: 0}])])\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()\n",
     "rawQuery": true,
     "resultFormat": "time_series"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "decimals": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "NONE",
         "color": "#0ca30c",
         "index": 0
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#0ca30c",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "#d03b3b",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "orientation": "auto",
    "textMode": "value",
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
    "showPercentChange": false,
    "text": {
     "titleSize": 16,
     "valueSize": 36
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "id": 6,
   "title": "Alert Rules -- click a cell to change it",
   "description": "One row per detector. Click On/Off to switch a source, Alert at to choose the lowest severity that runs the command (1 critical ... 4 info), Command to edit it (the Command box at the top is filled in; change it there, then Confirm it in Pending Command Change), and Send test to run the command once with a made-up alert. A source without a command of its own runs the Default command.\n\nSwitching a source on, or lowering its threshold, does not fire what is already in the last 10 minutes: only what arrives afterwards alerts. A repeat of the same thing (same signature and hosts, same ARP alert and address, same scanner...) is held for ALERTING_REPEAT_SECONDS (1 h) and the next command carries how many were held ($ALERT_REPEATS).\n\nThis panel is the one that sends the boxes, so it always shows the state after the change.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 10,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 5
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
    "uid": "infinity"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
      "uid": "infinity"
     },
     "type": "json",
     "parser": "backend",
     "source": "url",
     "format": "table",
     "url": "http://alerter:8090/apply?enable=${enable:percentencode}&disable=${disable:percentencode}&severity=${severity:percentencode}&command_for=${command_for:percentencode}&command=${command:percentencode}&confirm=${confirm:percentencode}&cancel=${cancel:percentencode}&test=${test:percentencode}&site=${site}",
     "url_options": {
      "method": "GET"
     },
     "root_selector": "",
     "columns": [
      {
       "selector": "name",
       "text": "name",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "enabled",
       "text": "enabled",
       "type": "number"
      },
      {
       "selector": "severity_text",
       "text": "severity_text",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "effective_command",
       "text": "effective_command",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "command_origin",
       "text": "command_origin",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "test_token",
       "text": "test_token",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "last_at",
       "text": "last_at",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "last_result",
       "text": "last_result",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "about",
       "text": "about",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "source",
       "text": "source",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "command",
       "text": "command",
       "type": "string"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "align": "auto",
      "filterable": false,
      "cellOptions": {
       "type": "auto"
      }
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "On"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "value",
          "options": {
           "1": {
            "text": "ON",
            "color": "#0ca30c",
            "index": 0
           },
           "0": {
            "text": "OFF",
            "color": "#9ca3af",
            "index": 1
           },
           "-1": {
            "text": "--",
            "color": "transparent",
            "index": 2
           }
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "color-background"
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 80
       },
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "Switch on",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=&var-command=&var-enable=${__data.fields.source}"
         },
         {
          "title": "Switch off",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=&var-command=&var-disable=${__data.fields.source}"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Alert at"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "1 critical only",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=&var-command=&var-severity=${__data.fields.source}:1"
         },
         {
          "title": "2 high and above",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=&var-command=&var-severity=${__data.fields.source}:2"
         },
         {
          "title": "3 medium and above",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=&var-command=&var-severity=${__data.fields.source}:3"
         },
         {
          "title": "4 everything, info too",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=&var-command=&var-severity=${__data.fields.source}:4"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 170
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Command"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "Edit this command (fills the Command box at the top)",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=${__data.fields.source}&var-command=${__data.fields.command:percentencode}"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Test"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "regex",
          "options": {
           "pattern": ".+",
           "result": {
            "text": "Send test",
            "index": 0
           }
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 100
       },
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "Run the command once with a test alert",
          "targetBlank": false,
          "url": "/d/alerting?${__url_time_range}&${site:queryparam}&var-enable=&var-disable=&var-severity=&var-confirm=&var-cancel=&var-test=&var-command_for=&var-command=&var-test=${__data.fields.source}:${__data.fields.test_token}"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Uses"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 80
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Last result"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 120
       },
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "regex",
          "options": {
           "pattern": "^(test-)?ok$",
           "result": {
            "color": "#0ca30c",
            "index": 0
           }
          }
         },
         {
          "type": "regex",
          "options": {
           "pattern": ".+",
           "result": {
            "color": "#d03b3b",
            "index": 1
           }
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "color-text"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byRegexp",
       "options": "^(source|command)$"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.hidden",
        "value": true
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "cellHeight": "sm"
   },
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {},
      "indexByName": {
       "name": 0,
       "enabled": 1,
       "severity_text": 2,
